  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDG Web Dashboard - Phase II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SDGs plattform fas II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja utvecklingen av en interaktiv och skalbar webbsida d&#xe4;r Colombias framsteg inom ramen f&#xf6;r FN:s globala h&#xe5;llbarhetsm&#xe5;l f&#xf6;ljs upp. Detta ska ske genom att st&#xe4;rka den digitala instrumentbr&#xe4;da som formgavs i fas 1.

Fas 1 resulterade i en digital plattform med syfte att synligg&#xf6;ra uppfyllandet av de globala h&#xe5;llbarhetsm&#xe5;len i Colombia. Struktur, logik och metodik utformades i enlighet med IOM:s krav, det nationella planeringskontorets DNP:s behov, nationella statistikbyr&#xe5;n DANE:s tillg&#xe4;ngliga information och svenska ambassadens kriterier. Plattformen (fas 1) &#xe4;r dock en prototyp som kr&#xe4;ver vidareutveckling och f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning f&#xf6;r att kunna bli ett webbaserat verktyg som ger regeringen m&#xf6;jlighet att &#xf6;vervaka varje enskilt h&#xe5;llbarhetsm&#xe5;l, och som ger colombianer tillg&#xe5;ng till data grundat p&#xe5; en princip om &#xf6;ppen f&#xf6;rvaltning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution&apos;s overall objective is to contribute to the development of an interactive and scalable website to follow up on Colombia&apos;s progress in relation to the achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) by strengthening the digital dashboard prototype designed in Phase I.

The result of the first phase was a digital platform to visualize the achievement of the SDGs in Colombia. Its structure, logic, and methodology were designed according to IOM&#xb4;s requirements, NPD needs, DANE&apos;s available information and the Swedish Embassy&#xb4;s criteria. This digital platform (Phase 1)  is, however, a prototype that needs to be further developed and needs to be strengthened in order to become an interactive web-based tool that allows the government to monitor each SDG and the Colombian population to have access on an open-government basis. This will be the overall objective of Phase 2.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution&apos;s overall objective is to contribute to the development of an interactive and scalable website to follow up on Colombia&apos;s progress in relation to the achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) by strengthening the digital dashboard prototype designed in Phase I.
Specifically, this second&#x2019;s phase objective was to continue with the start-up of the tool, which seeks to develop the operating system, the design of the contents and the data processing of the site, as well as the transfer of the administration from Colombia&#x2019;s statistical department (DANE) and the National Planning Department (DNP). This phaseis executed in partnership with Data Act Lab, Swedish firm responsible for thedesign of the initial prototype. The web page&apos;s address is www.ods.gov.co/en</narrative>
  </description>
